hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2859","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Bashshar, who narrated to us Abdur-Rahman, who narrated to us Sufyan, on the authority of Abu Ishaq, on the authority of Amr bin Maimun, on the authority of Umar bin Al-Khattab (RA), who said: ""The polytheists would not depart from 'Arafat (Jama') until the sun rose over Thabir. So the Prophet (ﷺ) differed from them and departed before the sun rose."""
